# retired corpora / dead port logs / finished working notes (see archive/README.md).
# Whole tree is maintainer-only: the patterns above already match most of what's in
# there, but anchor the dir so nothing under it can be published by a `git add -A`.
/archive/
release.env
# internal working docs / lab journals — maintainer context, not published.
# Root-anchored so it ignores ONLY the maintainer doc, not the fixture
# CLAUDE.md files shipped under experiments/ (those are test inputs, tracked).
/CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.md.archive-*
cv-settings-deny.json
.venv/
venv/
